    "CLEAR is a latch here: press it, then a step button, to set the last step. On the machine it is held down. Whether CLEAR also resets a rhythm's pre-scale is unverified; here it does not.",
    "Whether a tapped fill-in counts as a measure of the automatic fill-in, and whether the first-beat rule applies outside manual play and compose, is not in the manual. Here a tapped fill-in counts and the rule is theirs alone.",
